  "releaseNotes": "- Added .NET 10 support (multi-target: net8.0, net9.0, net10.0)\n\t\t\t- Enhanced text editor with file-type detection (JSON, JSONC, CSS, JS, Python, SQL, YAML, Markdown, etc.)\n\t\t\t- Editor now stays open after save with toast notifications\n\t\t\t- Added Ctrl+S keyboard shortcut for saving\n\t\t\t- Added unsaved changes indicator and warning before closing\n\t\t\t- Removed unnecessary dependencies",
